{"4678780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Solar Drift", "steam_appid": 4678780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are stranded near Pluto. An alien invasion is coming from the Sun, moving outward. Your goal is Earth. But how you get there is up to you. No rules, no forced paths. Just you and the solar system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/7906c3c0378c5171cd9798dcac5d42a5.poster.avif?t=1780261578\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/7906c3c0378c5171cd9798dcac5d42a5.webm?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/7906c3c0378c5171cd9798dcac5d42a5.mp4?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FARMING AND HOUSING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put down cozy shelters with a nice view of the planets. Set up glass farming domes to grow your own food. Make a safe, quiet place in the dark space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/4660116f74ce6c74a8ab92c75fe75704.poster.avif?t=1780261578\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/4660116f74ce6c74a8ab92c75fe75704.webm?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/4660116f74ce6c74a8ab92c75fe75704.mp4?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook your favorite meals and survive longer thanks to the buffs. But remember: you can also sell your food for a good price!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/3aacf4bb98885e5a6b7cdf6cfd6e50da.poster.avif?t=1780261578\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/3aacf4bb98885e5a6b7cdf6cfd6e50da.webm?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/3aacf4bb98885e5a6b7cdf6cfd6e50da.mp4?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE OPEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The solar system moves like a giant clock. You can only fly closer to Earth when the planets align. When the time is right, hop in your ship and fly to the next world with no loading screens. Trade with wandering survivors and see what the universe has to offer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/a470f5153196da1e4451aa28b29707e7.poster.avif?t=1780261578\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/a470f5153196da1e4451aa28b29707e7.webm?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/a470f5153196da1e4451aa28b29707e7.mp4?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD, CRAFT AND RESEARCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your tech points to figure things out. Turn your rocks and ores into useful items. Make a better multitool, fix up your ship, unlock stronger defenses, and discover new ways to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/b74acd4f9c0fcbb79224e0c5ebc5ae4c.poster.avif?t=1780261578\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/b74acd4f9c0fcbb79224e0c5ebc5ae4c.webm?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/b74acd4f9c0fcbb79224e0c5ebc5ae4c.mp4?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCAVENGE WRECKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doomed ships drifting in space might hold valuable loot! Float over to their decks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/c4c1d4337feb2fe8a413e8a0569cde5c.poster.avif?t=1780261578\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/c4c1d4337feb2fe8a413e8a0569cde5c.webm?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/c4c1d4337feb2fe8a413e8a0569cde5c.mp4?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself against space pirates and the alien horde, whether you are battling deep underground or out in the vacuum of space. Put down some auto-turrets to keep your little base safe while you work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/eedf621b23c85671b5c6edf27343615c.poster.avif?t=1780261578\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/eedf621b23c85671b5c6edf27343615c.webm?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/eedf621b23c85671b5c6edf27343615c.mp4?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go deep into dark caves or break apart asteroids. Dig for ores, find strange relics, and get the materials you need to stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/c69562a6760f05ab049784c11f5ed36f.poster.avif?t=1780261578\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/c69562a6760f05ab049784c11f5ed36f.webm?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/c69562a6760f05ab049784c11f5ed36f.mp4?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIFT HOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you leave your cozy base to get closer to Earth, or stay for one more orbit?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/d3c80a72b4d0768136add1cb49e1fa14.poster.avif?t=1780261578\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/d3c80a72b4d0768136add1cb49e1fa14.webm?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678780/extras/d3c80a72b4d0768136add1cb49e1fa14.mp4?t=1780261578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "ab